\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The user's seven-island map, reproduced unchanged. Islands name objects and tasks, not completed steps. Connections are proposed routes, not certified implications; broken bridges mark unproved transfers, not universal impossibility. Schematic formulae do not establish isomorphisms, savings, or prime-pair asymptotics: the hypotheses in the text govern those claims. Map Bridge A contains both analytic Gate A and Gate B; map Bridge B concerns the distinguished arithmetic seed. Rare-event mass alone does not establish recurrence at that seed. The full-resolution companion preserves the small labels for enlargement.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:map}{{1}{5}{The user's seven-island map, reproduced unchanged. Islands name objects and tasks, not completed steps. Connections are proposed routes, not certified implications; broken bridges mark unproved transfers, not universal impossibility. Schematic formulae do not establish isomorphisms, savings, or prime-pair asymptotics: the hypotheses in the text govern those claims. Map Bridge A contains both analytic Gate A and Gate B; map Bridge B concerns the distinguished arithmetic seed. Rare-event mass alone does not establish recurrence at that seed. The full-resolution companion preserves the small labels for enlargement}{figure.1}{}}
